#: preferences.py:45
msgid "A vertex counts as symmetric if a partner exists within this distance of its mirrored position"
msgstr "如果顶点在其镜像位置的此距离内存在配对顶点，则该顶点视为对称"

#: preferences.py:22
msgid "Act on the whole mesh. Turn off to affect only the geometry currently selected"
msgstr "作用于整个网格。关闭后仅影响当前选中的几何体"

#: ops_flick.py:44
msgid "Add or update a bisecting Mirror modifier"
msgstr "添加或更新二分镜像修改器"

#: preferences.py:28
msgid "After a whole-mesh symmetrize, dissolve the flat / redundant part of the center edge loop. Curved detail at the seam is kept"
msgstr "对整个网格执行对称化后，融并中心循环边的平坦/多余部分。接缝处的弯曲细节会保留"

#: preferences.py:71
msgid "Axes follow the transform orientation (Global / Local); the mirror plane passes through the pivot point."
msgstr "轴跟随变换方向（全局/局部）；镜像平面穿过枢轴点。"

